  "label": "Fictional character from Star Wars",
  "description": "Yoda is a fictional character from the Star Wars universe, portrayed as a wise, ancient, and powerful Jedi Master. His image is used in memes to convey authority, wisdom, or judgment. In this context, his association with wisdom is subverted to deliver an abusive message, which relies on the audience recognizing his iconic status and the contrast between his usual benevolent persona and the cruel text. This requires background knowledge of his character and role in the franchise.",
